# The AI Agents' governance runtime (Recovery Packages under runtime/backups/, governance bookkeeping
# under runtime/governance/ — approvals, audit, recovery index, rollback audit, write-execution audit,
# knowledge gaps, write-verification profiles) used to live under this backend folder. It was moved to
# <repository-root>/runtime/ (see BlueprintOS.Infrastructure/Persistence/Governance/RuntimeRootLocator.cs):
# the runtime belongs to the SOMA BlueprintOS platform, not to any one application inside it. The
# repository root's own .gitignore (`/runtime/`) is what actually keeps it out of version control now;
# this file has nothing left to ignore here, kept only so a stray local `runtime/` folder created by an
# old build/config override never gets committed by accident.
runtime/
